        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K358, Manhattan Collection Plate with Either Knob or Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Manhattan Latchset features a unique shape that really adds a sense of movement to any space. It is both elegant and fancy, with just enough intrest to draw the eye without stealing the show, which no one really wants their door knob to do! It is available in a wide array of finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. There is a huge selection of knobs and levers to choose from to accompany the backplate, so you're sure to find something that you truly love. The Manhattan Collection Plate is 2-5/8 inches wide and 7-11/16 inches tall. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D07-K358 Manhattan Collection Latchset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob/lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. The finish for the knob or lever you choose will match the plate finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Manhattan Latchset, Brass Accents D07-K358",
                "description": "Brass Accents D07-K358, Manhattan Latchset - The Manhattan Latchset features a unique shape that really adds a sense of movement to any space. It is both elegant and fancy, with just enough intrest to draw the eye without stealing the show, which no one really wants their door knob to do! It is available in a wide array of finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. There is a huge selection of knobs and levers to choose from to accompany the backplate, so you're sure to find something that you truly love. The Manhattan Collection Plate is 2-5/8 inches wide and 7-11/16 inches tall. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.  \r\n",
